WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.100
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:14.600
Touch and hold the task

3
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.200
Move to Someday

4
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.700
It waits in Someday — out of Today, the plan and reminders

5
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.300
Tap Someday to see what's waiting

6
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:28.200
There it waits

7
00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.700
When you want it back…

8
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:41.200
…Make Active
